 "voz": {
  "en": {
   "Some families are getting ready for a long trip…": "voz/en/narrador-00.m4a",
   "…and you go first. That red dot is Mars!": "voz/en/narrador-01.m4a",
   "Chapter 1: The Trip. Keep the crew safe on the way to Mars.": "voz/en/narrador-02.m4a",
   "Chapter 1: The Trip. You made it! Mars is right ahead.": "voz/en/narrador-03.m4a",
   "Chapter 1: The Trip. The power ran out. Earth came to help. Let us try again.": "voz/en/narrador-04.m4a",
   "Chapter 1: The Trip. The air ran out. Earth came to help. Let us try again.": "voz/en/narrador-05.m4a",
   "Chapter 1: The Trip. The shield broke. Earth came to help. Let us try again.": "voz/en/narrador-06.m4a",
   "Chapter 1: The Trip. The crew took too much radiation. Earth came to help. Let us try again.": "voz/en/narrador-07.m4a",
   "Chapter 1: The Trip. Time ran out. Earth came to help. Let us try again.": "voz/en/narrador-08.m4a",
   "Chapter 2: Landing at Jezero. Land on Mars and start the colony.": "voz/en/narrador-09.m4a",
   "Chapter 2: Landing at Jezero. The colony is awake. Great work!": "voz/en/narrador-10.m4a",
   "Chapter 2: Landing at Jezero. The power ran out. Earth came to help. Let us try again.": "voz/en/narrador-11.m4a",
   "Chapter 2: Landing at Jezero. The air ran out. Earth came to help. Let us try again.": "voz/en/narrador-12.m4a",
   "Chapter 2: Landing at Jezero. The shield broke. Earth came to help. Let us try again.": "voz/en/narrador-13.m4a",
   "Chapter 2: Landing at Jezero. The crew took too much radiation. Earth came to help. Let us try again.": "voz/en/narrador-14.m4a",
   "Chapter 2: Landing at Jezero. Time ran out. Earth came to help. Let us try again.": "voz/en/narrador-15.m4a",
   "Hi! I'm Iris. I'll help you get the colony ready.": "voz/en/iris-00.m4a",
   "The families land in 100 sols.": "voz/en/iris-01.m4a",
   "A sol is one day on Mars.": "voz/en/iris-02.m4a",
   "Every choice costs something. Let's begin!": "voz/en/iris-03.m4a",
   "Good morning! The ship is awake.": "voz/en/iris-04.m4a",
   "My numbers look strange. Please check them.": "voz/en/iris-05.m4a",
   "The message travels slowly. We wait.": "voz/en/iris-06.m4a",
   "First we look. Release the satellite!": "voz/en/iris-07.m4a",
   "The shield looks perfect… or does it?": "voz/en/iris-08.m4a",
   "Light needs minutes to reach Earth.": "voz/en/iris-09.m4a",
   "Tess, the engineer.": "voz/en/tess-00.m4a",
   "The shield is stronger, but it eats lots of energy.": "voz/en/tess-01.m4a",
   "Where should the crew sleep and work?": "voz/en/tess-02.m4a",
   "We can build two things. Pick the first.": "voz/en/tess-03.m4a",
   "Nice! Now pick the second one.": "voz/en/tess-04.m4a",
   "Little power left. Where should it go?": "voz/en/tess-05.m4a",
   "Pick where our colony will stand.": "voz/en/tess-06.m4a",
   "Two modules fit today. Pick the first.": "voz/en/tess-07.m4a",
   "I say shield. We keep working inside.": "voz/en/tess-08.m4a",
   "Nia, the doctor.": "voz/en/nia-00.m4a",
   "Safer inside, but food and water are harder to reach.": "voz/en/nia-01.m4a",
   "Fresh air keeps the crew healthy.": "voz/en/nia-02.m4a",
   "Think about air and food. Pick another.": "voz/en/nia-03.m4a",
   "I say shelter. Safety comes first.": "voz/en/nia-04.m4a",
   "Vera, the solar expert.": "voz/en/vera-00.m4a",
   "Wait… the Sun is acting up!": "voz/en/vera-01.m4a",
   "A storm is coming! Shelter, or a stronger shield?": "voz/en/vera-02.m4a",
